{
  "metadata": {
    "defaults": {
      "importMode": "COMMIT",
      "importStrategy": "CREATE_AND_UPDATE",
      "identifier": "ASSIGNED",
      "atomicMode": "ALL",
      "async": false,
      "preheatMode": "FULL"
    },
    "allowed": {
      "importMode": ["VALIDATE", "COMMIT"],
      "importStrategy": ["CREATE", "UPDATE", "CREATE_AND_UPDATE", "DELETE"],
      "identifier": ["ASSIGNED", "EXISTING", "AUTO"],
      "atomicMode": ["ALL", "NONE"],
      "async": [true, false],
      "preheatMode": ["FULL", "REQUIRED", "NONE"]
    },
    "nonDefaultRequiresConfirmation": [
      "importStrategy",
      "identifier",
      "atomicMode",
      "preheatMode"
    ],
    "async": {
      "thresholdObjects": 500,
      "mechanism": "query-params",
      "param": "async=true",
      "taskResource": "system.tasks",
      "jobRefField": "response",
      "statusField": "status",
      "terminalStatuses": ["COMPLETED", "ERROR"],
      "reportField": "response"
    },
    "reportShape": {
      "kindCounts": ["stats"],
      "typeField": "klass",
      "objectListFields": ["objects", "detailedMessages"],
      "severityField": "level",
      "statusField": "status",
      "uidField": "params",
      "codeField": "code"
    }
  },
  "tracker": {
    "defaults": {
      "importMode": "COMMIT",
      "importerVersion": "VERSIONED",
      "atomicMode": "ALL",
      "async": false,
      "lastUpdatedMode": "EXTEND"
    },
    "allowed": {
      "importMode": ["VALIDATE", "COMMIT"],
      "importerVersion": ["VERSIONED", "LEGACY"],
      "atomicMode": ["ALL", "NONE", "DEFER"],
      "async": [true, false],
      "lastUpdatedMode": ["EXTEND", "REPLACE", "PRESERVE"]
    },
    "nonDefaultRequiresConfirmation": ["importerVersion", "atomicMode", "lastUpdatedMode"],
    "async": {
      "thresholdObjects": 500,
      "mechanism": "query-params",
      "param": "async=true",
      "taskResource": "system.tasks",
      "statusField": "status",
      "terminalStatuses": ["COMPLETED", "ERROR"]
    }
  },
  "notes": [
    "DX-EXE-011：默认值就是“以 UID 作为标识符（identifier=ASSIGNED）、创建并更新",
    "(importStrategy=CREATE_AND_UPDATE)、全部成功或全部失败（atomicMode=ALL）”。",
    "调用方选择的非默认参数在执行计划里标记为需 DEPLOY_GATE 显式确认——上面",
    "nonDefaultRequiresConfirmation 列出的就是这些参数。",
    "async 阈值由 config.async_import_threshold 覆盖（DX-EXE-033，默认 500，可按环境配置）。"
  ]
}
